---
const year = 2026;
---

<footer class="mt-32 border-t border-line">
  <div
    class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col gap-6 px-5 py-12 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between sm:px-8"
  >
    <div>
      <p class="font-mono text-sm text-ink-2">GeoSoil</p>
      <p class="mt-1.5 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-3">
        A multi-modal, multi-truth latent representation of soil and place.
        Built on public data, on a single machine. Every number on this site is
        reproducible from the repository.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex gap-6 text-sm">
      <a class="text-ink-3 transition-colors hover:text-moss-600" href="/geosoil"
        >Case study</a
      >
      <a
        class="text-ink-3 transition-colors hover:text-moss-600"
        href="/geosoil#reproducibility">Reproduce</a
      >
      <a class="text-ink-3 transition-colors hover:text-moss-600" href="/about"
        >About</a
      >
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="border-t border-line/60">
    <div
      class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl items-center justify-between px-5 py-4 text-xs text-ink-faint sm:px-8"
    >
      <span class="tnum">© {year} · Luke Robinson</span>
      <span class="tnum">spatial-block CV · public data · no fabricated metrics</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
